  "note": "Lean proves only the specialization (φ = t²e^{−t²/2}, κ = 49, r₀ = 150000), with arcs at scale x/κ above the base level, levels up to ≈ x^{0.3}, c₊ = 2 and gx constants 0.8764, 2.526, 3.8 (book 0.5, 2.5, 3.36); final constant 1.0376 vs the book's 1.00948. This repairs the book's scale mix-up between the x-scale ℓ² input and the y-scale ℓ∞ input; minor_total now assumes PlattGRH and RamareMoebius."
